From 8fefa8595d44eb68d922405702ed7a0826322907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bart Smykla <bartek@smykla.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 16:37:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(api-server): harden localhost admin auth (#16416)

## Motivation

Localhost admin auth trusted browser-originated loopback requests. CORS
was also open by default.

## Implementation information

- keep localhost admin enabled by default while restricting it to direct
loopback
- make CORS opt-in by default
- require loopback `RemoteAddr` and `Host` before granting localhost
admin
- deny proxy-hop headers, cross-site fetch metadata, and non-localhost
`Origin` headers
- keep the API test harness explicit about localhost admin

---------

Signed-off-by: Bart Smykla <bartek@smykla.com>
